# ── 6 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
stage "Resend — API key"
say "Sign-in OTP emails, sent from joss@bleach.digital."
say ""
say "No DNS work here. bleach.digital is already a verified Resend sending"
say "domain — as checked before this wizard was written, it has:"
note "  MX    send.bleach.digital -> feedback-smtp.eu-west-1.amazonses.com"
