open_url "https://openrouter.ai/settings/keys"
step "Sign up or log in, then Create Key. Name it 'intake-prod'."
step "Set a credit limit on the key — a cheap blast radius if something loops."
step "Copy the key (starts sk-or-)."
ask_secret OPENROUTER_API_KEY "Paste the OpenRouter API key:"
write_env OPENROUTER_API_KEY "$OPENROUTER_API_KEY"
say ""
open_url "https://openrouter.ai/credits"
step "Add credit. ADR 0005's picks are cheap models; £5 goes a long way."
